  lines:
  - speakerName: Meep
    text: 'That top hat...that bow tie...

'
  - speakerName: Meep
    text: Oh my GOODNESS! You're Monsieur Cici! I have your Seed-D at home!
  - speakerName: Monsieur Cici
    text: Oui~ Tis I, Monsieur Cici! Always happy to meet a fan~
  - speakerName: Monsieur Cici
    text: Say, could you get me a berry? Feeling a little peckish~
